.TH TULPAR-SEARCH 1 "2026" "tulpar 0.2.0" "Tulpar Manual"
.SH NAME
tulpar-search \- search local and remote package indexes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tulpar search
.RI [ options "] " query
.br
.B tulpar s
.RI [ options "] " query
.br
.B tulpar \-s
.RI [ options "] " query
.SH DESCRIPTION
Searches the local package database and the cached repository indexes
for packages whose name or description contains
.IR query ,
case-insensitively. Results are grouped as installed and available.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-dest " " \fIpath\fR
Search the local database of an alternate root.
.TP
.BR \-j ", " \-\-json
Print results as a JSON array instead of human-readable text.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 regardless of whether any results were found.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tulpar (1),
.BR tulpar-list (1),
.BR tulpar-info (1)
